        "content": "### 2. URL validation\nAnswers Zoom's challenge automatically. Click **Validate** in Zoom after activating this workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9d03d2ae-ee43-4eb9-9784-8fb10ac804ac",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1296,
